<h3 #minor-adjustments>Minor Adjustments
<ul>
  <li>
    All lightning attacks deal piercing damage. This affects the following skills:
      <ul>
        <li>^{Link.skill "C" Shippuden "Flash Pillar"}
        <li>^{Link.skill "Omoi" Shippuden "Thunderbolt"}
        <li>^{Link.skill "Eight-Tailed B" Shippuden "Lariat"}
        <li>^{Link.skill "Sasuke Uchiha" Shippuden "Chidori Stream"}
  <li>
    All fire attacks deal affliction damage. This affects the following skills:
      <ul>
        <li>^{Link.skill "Jiraiya" Original "Giant Flame Bomb"}
        <li>^{Link.skill "Atsui" Shippuden "Flame Slice"}
        <li>^{Link.skill "Madara Uchiha" Shippuden "Majestic Destroyer Flame"}
        <li>^{Link.skill "Yugito Nii" Shippuden "Flaming Cat Roar"}
        <li>^{Link.skill "Jiraiya" Shippuden "Giant Flame Bomb"}
        <li>^{Link.skill "Sasuke Uchiha" Shippuden "Dragon Flame"}
  <li>
    ^{Link.skill "Anko Mitarashi" Original "Dragon Flame"} adds 5 to all <i>bane</i> damage that the target receives, rather than only damage from Anko's skills.
  <li>
    ^{Link.skill "Anko Mitarashi" Original "Twin Snake Sacrifice"} bypasses invulnerability.
  <li>
    ^{Link.skill "Chukichi" Reanimated "Hidden Frost"} provides invulnerability to all ranged skills, not only physical and chakra ranged skills.
  <li>
    The ^{Link.skill "Demon Brothers" Original "Poison Gauntlet"} applies a weak, slow-acting poison.
  <li>
    ^{Link.skill "Drunken Lee" Original "Drunken Fist"} applies its status effect of ignoring all harmful effects from the start, rather than after its first turn of damage.
  <li>
    ^{Link.skill "Hashirama Senju" Reanimated "Deep Forest Creation"} increases the cooldowns of all enemy skills, not just non-mental skills.
  <li>
    ^{Link.skill "Hashirama Senju" Reanimated "Deep Forest Flourishing"} only resets the cooldowns of <i>Instant</i> skills.
  <li>
    ^{Link.skill "Hiashi Hyūga" Original "Eight Trigrams Air Palm Wall"} reflects skills onto their user, rather than a random enemy.
  <li>
    ^{Link.skill "Hinata Hyūga" Shippuden "Gentle Step Twin Lion Fists"} ignores enemies who are invulnerable to it.
  <li>
    ^{Link.skill "Hiruzen Sarutobi" Original "Reaper Death Seal"} bypasses invulnerability.
  <li>
    Instead of merely alerting when skills are used, ^{Link.skill "Ino Yamanaka" Shippuden "Proxy Surveillance"} reveals enemy cooldowns and invisible effects.
  <li>
    ^{Link.skill "Jiraiya" Shippuden "Toad Oil Bomb"} interrupts <i>Action</i> skills as well as <i>Control</i> skills.
  <li>
    ^{Link.skill "Kabuto Yakushi" Shippuden "Chakra Absorbing Snakes"} no longer stuns healing effects for 1 turn. Instead, if the target restores health to anyone next turn, all of their skills will be stunned for 2 turns.
  <li>
    ^{Link.skill "Kitsuchi" Shippuden "Rock Fist"} prevents its target from applying counter effects, rather than stunning skills that include a countering effect.
  <li>
    ^{Link.skill "Maki" Shippuden "Humidified Cloth"} blocks the target from affecting the user's team at all.
  <li>
    ^{Link.skill "Naruto Uzumaki" Shippuden "Rasen Shuriken"} and ^{Link.skill "Sage Mode Naruto" Shippuden "Rasen Shuriken"} permanently weaken the target's chakra damage.
  <li>
    The cost of ^{Link.skill "Omoi" Shippuden "Crescent Moon Slice"} has been changed from 1 genjutsu chakra and 1 arbitrary chakra to 1 taijutsu chakra and 1 arbitrary chakra.
  <li>
    ^{Link.skill "Omoi" Shippuden "Thunderbolt"} blocks its target from affecting their allies at all.
  <li>
    ^{Link.skill "Sai" Shippuden "Ink Mist"} bypasses invulnerability.
  <li>
    ^{Link.skill "Yoroi Akadō" Original "Draining Assault"} applies its weakening and strengthening status effects on each turn of its duration, rather than for 2 turns of its 3 turn duration.
  <li>
    ^{Link.skill "Young Kakashi" Original "Sharingan"} causes him to gain 1 random chakra if the target uses a skill that gains chakra.

